    "conclusion": "Guidance covers requested benign progress and failure containment without new numeric tolerances or claims of implemented protection.",
    "walkthroughs": [
      "Exact inactive zero uses ordinary gates and returns promptly; zero with incoming supply still solves; a zero allowance never causes 0/0 normalization.",
